<title>UK: BICC rises as Hoare issues &quot;buy&quot; note.</title>
<headline>BICC rises as Hoare issues &quot;buy&quot; note.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in cables and construction group BICC gained on Wednesday in response to a recommendation on the stock from analysts at its corporate brokers ABN Amro Hoare Govett, dealers said.</p>
<p>BICC shares rose 5-1/2p to 185p by 0749 GMT in volume of 154,000 shares.</p>
